From 2bac3741a5e86bc380b4a6418d1172d2a18193ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh McKinney <joshka@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0300
Subject: git: persist fetched refs in repo view

Store fetched Git refs in the view so one-off fetches can survive
across operations without becoming Git bookmarks. Include their normal
lifecycle behavior with view merges, remote rename/remove operations,
and Git import reachability pinning.

